# The same files check out on Windows and Linux: text uses LF everywhere (Python, Qt and git handle it on
# Windows too), except the PowerShell helpers, which Windows PowerShell prefers with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.wav binary
*.npz binary
*.onnx binary
*.xpi binary
*.zip binary
